{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-abcd-ef1234567890",
    "name": "PulseGrid — API Health Monitor",
    "description": "Health check collection for crm-service and erp-service.\n\nCoverage strategy:\n- /health on each service (liveness probe)\n- List endpoints on each core entity (read-only, always safe)\n- One POST with a clearly invalid payload to assert 422 validation is alive\n\nEnvironment variables expected (set via Newman --env-var or a .env file):\n  CRM_BASE_URL   — e.g. http://localhost:8000\n  ERP_BASE_URL   — e.g. http://localhost:8001\n\nAssertions: each request asserts the expected 2xx (or 422 for the invalid-payload tests).\nNon-2xx / unexpected codes make Newman exit non-zero, which the GitHub Actions step treats as failure.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "crm_base_url",
      "value": "http://localhost:8000",
      "description": "Override with CRM_BASE_URL env var in Newman invocation"
    },
    {
      "key": "erp_base_url",
      "value": "http://localhost:8001",
      "description": "Override with ERP_BASE_URL env var in Newman invocation"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "CRM Service",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "CRM — Health check",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{crm_base_url}}/health",
              "host": ["{{crm_base_url}}"],
              "path": ["health"]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"CRM /health returns 200\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test(\"CRM /health body has status ok\", function () {",
                  "    var json = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(json.status).to.eql(\"ok\");",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "CRM — List customers",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{crm_base_url}}/customers",
              "host": ["{{crm_base_url}}"],
              "path": ["customers"]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"CRM GET /customers returns 200\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test(\"CRM GET /customers returns an array\", function () {",
                  "    var json = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(json).to.be.an(\"array\");",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
